      <h2>Background</h2>
      <p>The work here is grounded in real construction experience — time on site, managing works, and designing and advising on temporary works. That background shapes the approach: designs and advice are practical, buildable and written for the people delivering the project.</p>
      <p>Support is offered remotely and on a project basis for UK and international contractors, with an emphasis on fast response and clear communication.</p>
      <h2>Approach</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Practical and buildable</strong> — advice you can act on, not just theory.</li>
        <li><strong>Clear communication</strong> — stated assumptions, clear design risk, useful comments.</li>
        <li><strong>Fast response</strong> — set up for short-notice and overflow work.</li>
        <li><strong>Site-focused</strong> — informed by construction and safety experience.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
